{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411170","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1441117001:1":{"text":"炮火进了它的眼连一粒灰尘都不如……","source_cn":"炮火进了它的眼连一粒灰尘都不如……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB7E01DE1F09680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441117002:1":{"text":"龙，就是这样的存在吗？","source_cn":"龙，就是这样的存在吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06B682D9CB533FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441117003:1":{"text":"天知道我在研究所里研究、改造、迭代了多少次！","source_cn":"天知道我在研究所里研究、改造、迭代了多少次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F383A6F6B319200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441117004:1":{"text":"聚能的方式，转换的效率，贯穿的精度……赫托啊！","source_cn":"聚能的方式，转换的效率，贯穿的精度……赫托啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4233E15524F40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1441117004":{"text":"聚能的方式，转换的效率，贯穿的精度……赫托啊！","source_cn":"聚能的方式，转换的效率，贯穿的精度……赫托啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F4233E15524F40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1